00:00:28.480 --> 00:00:34.760
In Russian we say cosmos, listen carefully, cosmos, cosmos.

00:00:35.220 --> 00:00:38.880
That means space, the universe, everything out there beyond our planet.

00:00:39.160 --> 00:00:42.320
It sounds almost exactly like the English word cosmos.

00:00:43.100 --> 00:00:44.640
What a perfect memory hook.

00:00:45.080 --> 00:00:49.220
When you hear cosmos, just think of the giant beautiful universe.

00:00:49.940 --> 00:00:54.720
Repeat after me slowly, cosmos, cosmos.

00:00:54.720 --> 00:01:00.300
Now say it at normal speed, cosmos, great job.

00:01:00.880 --> 00:01:04.500
You just said your very first space word in Russian.

00:01:05.140 --> 00:01:08.100
Feel proud, you're already on your way.

00:01:08.940 --> 00:01:11.020
Now let's learn more words about space.

00:01:11.540 --> 00:01:16.960
We'll start with the most exciting one, raketa, raketa, re-kita.

00:01:17.740 --> 00:01:22.580
That means rocket, you know those powerful machines that shoot up into the sky with fire

