00:01:38.640 --> 00:01:47.220
Repeat after me, luna, luna, again, luna, now let's add zvezda, zvezda, zvezda, that means

00:01:47.220 --> 00:01:47.680
star.

00:01:48.120 --> 00:01:50.480
Those tiny sparkling lights you see on a clear night.

00:01:50.480 --> 00:01:58.460
Repeat after me, zvezda, zvezda, good, zvezda, you already know cosmos, raketa, luna and

00:01:58.460 --> 00:01:58.920
zvezda.

