Let's add one more very important word, ze-mla, ze-mla, ze-mla, that means earth, our own

00:02:06.460 --> 00:02:08.260
blue planet where we all live.

00:02:08.780 --> 00:02:18.120
Repeat after me, ze-mla, ze-mla, excellent, ze-mla, the next word is sputnik, sputnik, sputnik,

00:02:18.120 --> 00:02:23.800
that means satellite, these are the machines we send up to orbit the earth and help us with

00:02:23.800 --> 00:02:26.260
communication, weather and science.

00:02:27.160 --> 00:02:33.360
Repeat after me, sputnik, sputnik, sputnik.

00:02:33.660 --> 00:02:37.020
Did you know the very first satellite in the whole world was Russian?

00:02:37.800 --> 00:02:42.920
It was called sputnik, because of that the whole planet learned this Russian word, that's

00:02:42.920 --> 00:02:45.680
why even in English we still say sputnik.

00:02:46.600 --> 00:02:48.980
Now let's meet the people who make all of this happen.

00:02:49.260 --> 00:02:54.920
The word is uchoni, uchoni, uchoni, that means scientist.

00:02:55.580 --> 00:02:59.020
The smart, curious people who study space and build rockets.

00:02:59.520 --> 00:03:03.840
Repeat after me, uchoni, uchoni, uchoni.

