If you understood that, you're already reading and speaking Russian.

00:06:18.460 --> 00:06:21.540
For the kids listening, grab some paper and crayons.

00:06:21.880 --> 00:06:26.020
Draw a big, colorful picture of a rocket flying toward the moon.

00:06:26.640 --> 00:06:30.840
In the sky, add some stars, and our planet Earth far below.

